Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Render SplitJacobianSolver in the API docs

The docs build failed: the docstrings of jacobian_cache and
uncoupled_jacobian_names link to SplitJacobianSolver, and no page
rendered it. The check in docs/check_docstring_refs.jl refuses a link
to a symbol no page renders. It is now in the Jacobian block of the
API page, with uncoupled_jacobian_names beside it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LA3FukgbRCMkra999BhdDw
---
 docs/src/api.md | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/src/api.md b/docs/src/api.md
index 51e0541..2a688b3 100644
--- a/docs/src/api.md
+++ b/docs/src/api.md
@@ -379,6 +379,8 @@ See the [Implicit Solver](implicit_solver.md) page for the algorithms.
 ClimaAtmos.Jacobian
 ClimaAtmos.JacobianAlgorithm
 ClimaAtmos.ManualSparseJacobian
+ClimaAtmos.SplitJacobianSolver
+ClimaAtmos.uncoupled_jacobian_names
 ClimaAtmos.AutoDenseJacobian
 ClimaAtmos.AutoSparseJacobian
 ClimaAtmos.AutoSparseJacobian()
